James Rising received an email from prospective Ph.D. candidate Rohit Dongre, who detailed his academic background in engineering and economics, mentioning his research interests in environmental economics, pollution mitigation, and social stratification in India. James commended Rohit on his experience but unfortunately noted he lacked funding to take on new students for Fall 2026. Rohit subsequently asked about future opportunities and expressed interest in contributing to James's research as a remote Research Assistant. James acknowledged the funding limitations, suggested checking back for Fall 2027, and declined the remote RA offer due to capacity constraints.
